 games yet even though it is in early stages of development it will soon be one of the best. Full of horror, fun and  even excitement Scary ape is the game FOR YOU! ", "short_description": "Scary Ape! a gtag horror game full of exiting thrills (and of course fun) this will be one of the best fangames so jump in now to be a 1 day or 1 week member. Also we have a very nice and friendly community. Anyway I'll leave you to play.\n-PoolVR"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/scaryape?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "PoolVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/scaryape?usp=sharing", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "7499305093449161"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031538_808112438034519_2028938530361174763_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JpoeBkflwAsQ7kNvwHtAcuT&_nc_oc=AdlaDIi3AIiUV_gDAWe_dN1P-kL8M-3znohqFf_fgVt62ZzMngtzhMYCxYah2pEqaF4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzxd2eiy2EacE4YXYBHEoKJwr_Wm_CBMTd9_5FWX0Xw6g&oe=69AAC84F"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Scary Ape", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "27